    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>Historical development of Keuskupan Palangka Raya, a Catholic diocese that covers Kalimantan Tengah Province, Indonesia; volume commemorating the 25th anniversary of Diocese of Palangka Raya and silver jubilee of the episcopal ordination of Monsignor Aloysius M. Sutrisnaatmaka.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
